desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "javascript"
	title: "数据流：Node.js CORS：请求 Origin 直接回显"
	title_zh: "数据流：Node.js CORS：请求 Origin 直接回显"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "ssa-js-cors-origin-reflection"
	risk: "cors"
	cwe: "CWE-942"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
响应头把请求的 `Origin` 原样写入 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin`，任意站点都可跨域读取响应。同时覆盖 `cors({ origin: true })` 配置。

### 风险类型
cors
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用固定 Origin 白名单；不要回显请求头。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	'file://app.js': <<<POS
function handler(req, res) {
  res.setHeader("Access-Control-Allow-Origin", req.headers.origin);
}
module.exports = handler;
POS
	'safefile://app-safe.js': <<<NEG
function handler(req, res) {
  res.setHeader("Access-Control-Allow-Origin", "https://app.example.com");
}
module.exports = handler;
NEG
)

<include('js-param')> as $params;

res.setHeader("Access-Control-Allow-Origin", * as $origin)

$origin?{<self> #{
    include: <<<CODE
* & $params as $__next__
CODE,
}->}?{!(<getUsers()>?{opcode: eq})}?{!(<getUsers()>?{opcode: neq})} as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Node.js CORS：请求 Origin 直接回显",
	title_zh: "Node.js CORS：请求 Origin 直接回显",
	risk: "cors",
}
